# Linux Network Services Lab

## Objective

Built an Ubuntu Server providing common network services
used in network and NOC environments.

## Environment

- Ubuntu Server
- VirtualBox
- SSH
- Apache
- BIND9
- UFW

## Services

| Service | Protocol | Port |
|---------|----------|------|
| SSH     | TCP      | 22   |
| HTTP    | TCP      | 80   |
| DNS     | TCP/UDP  | 53   |

## Network Troubleshooting

Used:

- ip
- ping
- traceroute
- ss
- curl
- dig
- systemctl
- journalctl

## Troubleshooting Exercise

Intentionally stopped Apache and diagnosed the
website connectivity failure.

Investigation:

1. Checked service status
2. Checked listening ports
3. Tested HTTP with curl
4. Checked service logs
5. Restarted Apache
6. Verified connectivity

